     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
           "text": "@Andrew Woods"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", it's good to know that I didn't break anything. Once you build and launch, you will see the key difference with the header element at the top of the page. It will stretch 100% of the window. Also, the header margins at smaller screen sizes are removed for a full bleed effect. ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "This might seem small, but it will help developers working in the bootstrap framework develop specific interfaces for their various applications or contributing back to the fedora4 project. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Link to differences:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
