     "body": "<p>Thanks for your contribution and description of the value. That is helpful. I will push this into the master branch, if you can just sign and return the \"icla.pdf\" linked from the following page:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DSP/Contributor+License+Agreements\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DSP/Contributor+License+Agreements</a></p>\n\n<p>In order to keep Fedora4 community-owned, all contributions must come with a CLA. Please return the signed icla to \"legal@duraspace.org\". I will see it.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks again.</p>",
